    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d706-f1" n="80" xml:id="d706-f1-content">
                <p>Telegram 121 not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d706-f2" n="81" xml:id="d706-f2-content">
                <p>A list dated September 14 and sent to SCAP, Tokyo, included the names of 45
                    persons as major Japanese war criminal suspects; two supplemental lists, dated
                    September 21 and 28, named 16 persons.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
